.el .ds Aq '
.TH runglass-review 1 2026-05-15 "runglass 0.3.0" "RunGlass Manual"
.SH NAME
runglass\-review \- Review a saved receipt and choose keep/revert/export/open actions
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBrunglass review\fR [\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIRECEIPT\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Review a saved receipt and choose keep/revert/export/open actions
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR \fI<NON_INTERACTIVE>\fR [default: fail]
Review behavior when stdin/stdout is not interactive
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
fail
.IP \(bu 2
summary
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIRECEIPT\fR] [default: latest]

.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  runglass review latest
  runglass review latest \-\-non\-interactive summary
  runglass review <receipt\-id>
